001E69  3  6D 06 19             ADC     PLOTX+1         ; Add the high byte of the second number (plus carry from previous op)
001E6C  3  85 FE                STA     TEMPW+1         ; Store the high byte of the result
001E6E  3                                               ; TEMPW IS NOW THE MEMORY ADDRESS
001E6E  3               
